{
  "name": "网页上传下载与元素属性小流程",
  "nl_examples": [
    "在网页上上传一个文件，再点链接把文件下载下来",
    "网页上传附件并下载另一个文件",
    "读出网页元素的文本内容，顺便测上传下载",
    "web 上传下载流程"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "网页上传",
    "网页下载",
    "上传附件",
    "下载文件",
    "元素属性",
    "获取元素文本"
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "url",
      "type": "Str",
      "default": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/",
      "describe": "测试页地址（本机 demo/test_page，含 file input 与下载链接）"
    },
    {
      "name": "out_dir",
      "type": "Str",
      "default": "F:\\AI-Workbench\\10-Projects\\星辰开源\\demo\\_browser_out",
      "describe": "待上传文件与下载结果的存放目录"
    }
  ],
  "element_requirements": [
    {
      "name": "测试页_上传文件框",
      "kind": "web",
      "pick": {
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/",
        "css": "#fileInput"
      },
      "note": "页面里的 <input type=file>，onchange 会把文件名写进 #upload-status"
    },
    {
      "name": "测试页_上传状态文本",
      "kind": "web",
      "pick": {
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/",
        "css": "#upload-status"
      },
      "note": "上传成功后文本会变成「已选择：xxx.csv」，用它做上传成功的证据"
    },
    {
      "name": "测试页_下载链接",
      "kind": "web",
      "pick": {
        "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8765/",
        "css": "#dl"
      },
      "note": "指向 download_sample.csv 的 <a download>"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "atom": "File.file_write",
      "alias": "造一个待上传的本地文件",
      "out": {
        "write_file_path": "upload_file"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "file_path": [
          "$p:out_dir",
          "/待上传附件.csv"
        ],
        "file_option": "create",
        "write_type": "overwrite",
        "msg": [
          "编号,品名,数量\nU01,上传测试,7\n"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserSoftware.browser_open",
      "alias": "打开测试页",
      "out": {
        "web_open": "web"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "url": "$p:url",
        "browser_type": "chrome",
        "timeout": 20,
        "timeout_handle_type": "execError",
        "wait_load_success": true,
        "open_with_incognito": false
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserSoftware.upload_web_file",
      "alias": "上传本地文件（模拟模式；两种模式的实测结论见取证文件）",
      "out": {
        "download_file": "uploaded"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "browser_obj": "$web",
        "element_data": "测试页_上传文件框",
        "upload_path": "$upload_file",
        "simulate_flag": true
      },
      "elements": {
        "element_data": {
          "kind": "web",
          "name": "测试页_上传文件框"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserElement.element_operation",
      "alias": "读上传状态文本（证明上传真的生效）",
      "out": {
        "get_ele_attr": "upload_text"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "browser_obj": "$web",
        "element_data": "测试页_上传状态文本",
        "operation_type": "get",
        "get_type": "getText",
        "attribute_name": "",
        "position": "webPageLeft",
        "attribute_value": "",
        "element_timeout": 10
      },
      "elements": {
        "element_data": {
          "kind": "web",
          "name": "测试页_上传状态文本"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserElement.element_operation",
      "alias": "读下载链接的 href（顺带验 getLink）",
      "out": {
        "get_ele_attr": "dl_link"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "browser_obj": "$web",
        "element_data": "测试页_下载链接",
        "operation_type": "get",
        "get_type": "getLink",
        "attribute_name": "",
        "position": "webPageLeft",
        "attribute_value": "",
        "element_timeout": 10
      },
      "elements": {
        "element_data": {
          "kind": "web",
          "name": "测试页_下载链接"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserSoftware.download_web_file",
      "alias": "按链接下载（click 模式需浏览器弹下载窗口，无人值守不可控）",
      "out": {
        "load_file": "downloaded"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "browser_obj": "$web",
        "element_data": "测试页_下载链接",
        "download_mode": "link",
        "link_str": "$dl_link",
        "save_path": "$p:out_dir",
        "custom_flag": true,
        "file_name": "下载结果.csv",
        "simulate_flag": false,
        "is_wait": true,
        "time_out": 30
      },
      "elements": {
        "element_data": {
          "kind": "web",
          "name": "测试页_下载链接"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "File.file_write",
      "alias": "写取证文件",
      "out": {
        "write_file_path": "evidence"
      },
      "inputs": {
        "file_path": [
          "$p:out_dir",
          "/网页上传下载取证.txt"
        ],
        "file_option": "create",
        "write_type": "overwrite",
        "msg": [
          "【测试页】",
          "$p:url",
          "\n【待上传文件】",
          "$upload_file",
          "\n【upload_web_file 返回值】",
          "$uploaded",
          "\n【element_operation getText → 上传状态】",
          "$upload_text",
          "\n【element_operation getLink → 下载链接】",
          "$dl_link",
          "\n【download_web_file 返回值】",
          "$downloaded",
          "\n\n【判读要点 1：上传】\n",
          "upload_web_file 返回值是 None，#upload-status 仍是「尚未选择文件」→ 上传**没有真正生效**。\n",
          "实测两种模式（2026-10-31，Chrome + 中文 Windows）：\n",
          "  simulate_flag=true  → 不抛错但静默无效（页面 file input 未被赋值）；\n",
          "  simulate_flag=false → 报「未弹出上传窗口」（10 秒内找不到 #32770/打开 对话框）。\n",
          "所以判断上传成功**必须看页面状态**，不能看返回值。\n",
          "\n【判读要点 2：下载】\n",
          "download_mode=click 会报「未弹出下载窗口」—— Chrome 默认「下载前不询问保存位置」，无窗口可操作；\n",
          "改用 download_mode=link 直接按 URL 取，实测成功。\n",
          "注意 file_name 传「下载结果.csv」会得到「下载结果.csv.csv」（原子自己又补了一次扩展名）。\n",
          "\n【判读要点 3：element_operation】\n",
          "字典声明 8 个输出、实现只 return 一个，按 8 个解包必错位；本流程已按单返回处理。\n",
          "getText / getLink 都正确取到了值，是本次上传未生效的**独立证据**。\n"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "atom": "BrowserSoftware.browser_close",
      "alias": "关闭浏览器",
      "out": {},
      "inputs": {
        "browser_obj": "$web"
      }
    }
  ]
}